{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653800/extras/3882526d211f93cf5992bacfbf650465.poster.avif?t=1760335646\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653800/extras/3882526d211f93cf5992bacfbf650465.webm?t=1760335646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653800/extras/3882526d211f93cf5992bacfbf650465.mp4?t=1760335646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On the Hunt</strong> is a hunting simulator in active development, blending wilderness exploration with realistic hunting mechanics. Immerse yourself in a detailed world of pristine nature where intelligent animals are wary and cautious. Track your prey and hone your hunting skills! The current early access version includes core mechanics and the first explorable region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CURRENTLY AVAILABLE:</strong><br>\u00a0Two types of shotguns with open sights<br>\u00a0One animal species: moose<br>\u00a0Starting location: detailed picturesque forest region<br>\u00a0Core mechanics: tracking, shooting, progression system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLANNED UPDATES:</strong><br>\u00a0Rifled weapons with optical scopes<br>\u00a0New animal species: boar, deer, bear, wolf, fox...<br>\u00a0Additional regions with unique environments<br>\u00a0Expanded arsenal and equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Join our hunting community! Your feedback and suggestions directly influence the game's development.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1653800?t=1760335646","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1653800?t=176033564